Resolution: Evaluate if the issue was resolved effectively and efficiently.
Communication: Assess if the communication was clear, timely, and professional.
Sentiment: Analyze the emotional tone of the interaction throughout its lifecycle.
Process Adherence: Determine if standard operating procedures were followed.
Actionable Insights: Your report must conclude with concrete recommendations for improvement, which can be directed towards the specific support agent, the overall support process, or the product/service itself.
Format: The final output must be presented in a clear, easy-to-read report format.
